# Squad Decisions

Before implementing or reviewing PO-Professional-Tools changes:

1. Read `.squad/decisions.md` (active section at top)
2. Respect hard gates: **feature branch only** (never `main`), PR required, `npm run lint` + `npm run build` before PR
3. New team directives → `.squad/decisions/inbox/{agent}-{slug}.md` (not direct edits to decisions.md)

If a user directive conflicts with an older decision, ask once — then follow the latest explicit user instruction and record it.
